  - m_Id: 2799574425600
    m_Localized: Pastor Ackermann
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2756092076032
    m_Localized: "Hello, welcome to the Preacher's Church in Erfurt! I'm Pastor Ackermann,
      and I'll guide you through the church. The church isn't just a place for worship\u2014it's
      also a piece of history. There are many different things to discover here;
      they're marked with a yellow symbol. You can simply click on the objects and
      I'll tell you fascinating facts about them! Each of these objects tells its
      own story\u2014about people who lived here, about important events, and about
      the faith that moved so many people. Have fun on your journey of discovery
      through the Preacher's Church!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8296406949888
    m_Localized: Our tour is now over. However, you're welcome to take a look around
      the Preacher's Church and explore everything at your leisure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
